{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-information-theory","title":"创立信息论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-information-theory","title":"信息论之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/the-father-of-information-theory","wordCount":1903,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","title":"《通信的数学理论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","wordCount":1778,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 创立信息论\n\n本章呈现香农创立信息论的贡献。香农，被尊为\"信息论之父\",几乎独力地创立了信息论；他的一九四八年论文《通信的数学理论》，是信息论的奠基之作。两篇文档，分别呈现信息论之父，以及《通信的数学理论》。\n"}